1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,070
It too divides tangentially.

2
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:04,492
Outwards it cuts off cork, the phellem.

3
00:00:04,492 --> 00:00:11,588
Its walls are soaked with suberin, the cells die, and the layer becomes waterproof and gas proof.

4
00:00:11,588 --> 00:00:18,736
Inwards it cuts off phelloderm, a thin layer of living cells sometimes called secondary cortex.

